1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:01,436
Hello, and welcome.

2
00:00:01,436 --> 00:00:06,179
By the end of this course you will have built four working agents: one that triages

3
00:00:06,179 --> 00:00:10,809
your inbox, one that turns a meeting recording into action items, one that writes

4
00:00:10,809 --> 00:00:15,381
your weekly report, and one that chases the follow ups you keep meaning to send.

5
00:00:15,381 --> 00:00:19,896
I've spent years building AI products in Silicon Valley and at major technology

6
00:00:19,896 --> 00:00:24,639
companies, including ByteDance, and the pattern that shows up in every one of those

7
00:00:24,639 --> 00:00:29,440
jobs is the same one you'll meet in your own inbox this week: the boring, repeatable

8
00:00:29,440 --> 00:00:34,241
part of the work is exactly what a properly supervised agent is good at, and exactly

9
00:00:34,241 --> 00:00:37,555
