12
00:00:46,528 --> 00:00:48,871
There is no code anywhere in this course.

13
00:00:49,421 --> 00:00:53,623
Each agent ships as a downloadable workflow you import in a couple of clicks.

14
00:00:53,623 --> 00:00:58,206
Alongside them you get six more artifacts: a job description template for onboarding

15
00:00:58,206 --> 00:01:02,353
an agent properly, a trial task checklist, a spot check rubric, a guardrails

16
00:01:02,353 --> 00:01:06,773
