17
00:01:06,773 --> 00:01:08,028
Ten artifacts in total.

18
00:01:08,028 --> 00:01:10,865
You will use the first one before this section ends.

19
00:01:10,865 --> 00:01:13,812
Threaded through the whole course is one running case.

20
00:01:13,812 --> 00:01:18,013
Priya Malhotra manages renewals at Calloway and Finch, a commercial insurance

21
00:01:18,013 --> 00:01:22,160
brokerage: one hundred and eighty staff, three regional offices, and not one

22
00:01:22,160 --> 00:01:23,469
engineer on the payroll.

23
00:01:23,469 --> 00:01:27,998
Priya looks after forty one accounts on her own, and you will watch her onboard all

24
00:01:27,998 --> 00:01:32,200
four of these agents against her real week, mistake by mistake, save by save.

25
00:01:32,200 --> 00:01:34,164
She is not the expert in this story.

26
00:01:34,164 --> 00:01:35,965
She is you, a few weeks from now.

27
00:01:36,515 --> 00:01:40,965
That is the whole course in one sentence, and we will come back to it constantly.

28
00:01:40,965 --> 00:01:45,250
You would never hand a brand new hire your whole inbox on their first morning.

29
00:01:45,250 --> 00:01:49,811
The same caution applies here, and it is the difference between people who get real

30
00:01:49,811 --> 00:01:53,656
