34
00:02:03,436 --> 00:02:06,623
If a lecture ever sounds like a sales page, I have failed.

35
00:02:06,623 --> 00:02:09,370
Second, nothing here asks you to become technical.

36
00:02:09,370 --> 00:02:12,007
Priya never writes a line of code in this story.

37
00:02:12,007 --> 00:02:12,941
Neither will you.

38
00:02:12,941 --> 00:02:17,281
I built this for the person who owns Section 0's problem for real: forty unread

39
00:02:17,281 --> 00:02:21,457
